{"documentId":"tos.work.friedrich-nietzsche.also-sprach-zarathustra","versionId":"dta-first-editions-de","revision":"1a3710dd81760227e42575901e51d55656c25615acd888ec6ca4c2fa5f5d99d6","units":[{"id":"tos.text-unit.sid-947f5ac6e15b64c4a0445d01a338ce4c","ordinal":3441,"kind":"paragraph","language":"de","reference":"Unit 3441","text":"Diess ist mein Morgen, mein Tag hebt an:\nherauf nun, herauf, du grosser Mittag!“ — —"},{"id":"tos.text-unit.sid-7ccacf7def856540e0472211fc54d3e2","ordinal":3442,"kind":"paragraph","language":"de","reference":"Unit 3442","text":"Also sprach Zarathustra und verliess seine Höhle,\nglühend und stark, wie eine Morgensonne, die aus\ndunklen Bergen kommt."},{"id":"tos.text-unit.sid-8d196729b153c49989bdf25466f74ff0","ordinal":3443,"kind":"paragraph","language":"de","reference":"Unit 3443","text":"Ende von Also sprach Zarathustra."}]}